# Machine Learning Case Studies

This repository contains different Machine Learning case studies implemented using Python and Scikit-learn.

## Case Studies

1. Ball Classification
2. K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)
3. Linear Regression
4. Decision Tree

## Technologies Used

- Python
- NumPy
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn

